  Description:

    The TMVROMZ055AAA is a synchronous VIA ROM compiler.
    It's based on ICSprout 55nm Process. It can generate 
    the memory instance by the different words and bits configuration. It
    supports the mux ratio to meet the different aspect ratio and timing
    request. 
    The TMVROMZ055AAA includes Verilog behavioral models, Liberty timing models,
    LEF, CPF, and an all-zero .romcode file.
    

  Symbol

                                        |
                              __________|___________
                             |         CLK          |
                             |                      |
                             |                      |
                          ---|A                     |
                          ---|CEB                   |
                          ---|MAR                   |
                             |                     Q|---
                          ---|MARE                  |
                             |                      |
                             |                      |
                             |______________________|
  Features:

    - Auto leakage control technique to reduce standby current
    - Support power gating mode to reduce static power
    - Margin adjustment option for speed/yield optimization
    - Fully customized and optimized layout to get minimum area
    - Multi column mux option for area and speed optimization
    - Operation voltage at 1.2v +/- 10% 
    - Synchronous read operations
    - Support RVT and HVT+RVT peripherals
    - Clocked address,chip enable
    


