    | TT1P2V25CCTYP   | TT      | 1.2        | 25             | 0111        | 
    +-----------------+---------+------------+----------------+-------------+
    | TT1P2V85CCTYP   | TT      | 1.2        | 85             | 0111        | 
    +-----------------+---------+------------+----------------+-------------+
    | FF1P32VM40CCMIN | FF      | 1.32       | -40            | 0111        | 
    +-----------------+---------+------------+----------------+-------------+
    | FF1P32V0CCMIN   | FF      | 1.32       | 0              | 0111        | 
    +-----------------+---------+------------+----------------+-------------+
    | FF1P32V125CCMIN | FF      | 1.32       | 125            | 0111        | 
    +-----------------+---------+------------+----------------+-------------+
    | SS1P08VM40CCMAX | SS      | 1.08       | -40            | 0111        | 
    +-----------------+---------+------------+----------------+-------------+
    | SS1P08V0CCMAX   | SS      | 1.08       | 0              | 0111        | 
    +-----------------+---------+------------+----------------+-------------+
    | SS1P08V125CCMAX | SS      | 1.08       | 125            | 0111        | 
    +=================+=========+============+================+=============+
    Notes:
      1. Voltage: Power supply for memory block  
      2. Temperature : Junction operating temperature 


  MAR Option:

    =============================================================
    | MARE | MAR[3:0] | Valid | Remark                        |
    =============================================================
    |   1  |  0000~1111 |   V   | "0000" largest margin
    |      |            |       |        slowest speed
    |      |            |       | "1111" smallest margin        |
    |      |            |       |        fastest speed          |
    -------------------------------------------------------------
    |   0  |  X X X X   |   V   |default setting (characterized)|
    |      |            |       |"XXXX" means don't care and    |
    |      |            |       |       needs to logic 1 or 0   |
    =============================================================
    _____________________________________________________________


