  Power Consumption:

    +=================+===============+===============+=================+===============+=================+=================+===============+=================+============+
    I Power Type      | TT1P2V25CCTYP | TT1P2V85CCTYP | FF1P32VM40CCMIN | FF1P32V0CCMIN | FF1P32V125CCMIN | SS1P08VM40CCMAX | SS1P08V0CCMAX | SS1P08V125CCMAX | Unit       | 
    +=================+===============+===============+=================+===============+=================+=================+===============+=================+============+
    | Standby Leakage | 0.141         | 1.367         | 0.172           | 0.951         | 35.166          | 0.002           | 0.003         | 0.580           | uA (CEB=1) | 
    +-----------------+---------------+---------------+-----------------+---------------+-----------------+-----------------+---------------+-----------------+------------+
    | DC Leakage      | 0.192         | 2.066         | 0.186           | 1.091         | 48.052          | 0.002           | 0.005         | 1.102           | uA (CEB=0) | 
    +-----------------+---------------+---------------+-----------------+---------------+-----------------+-----------------+---------------+-----------------+------------+
    | Read Current    | 0.893         | 0.900         | 0.938           | 0.946         | 0.966           | 0.881           | 0.884         | 0.893           | uA/MHz     | 
    +=================+===============+===============+=================+===============+=================+=================+===============+=================+============+

    Total current   = AC current * Frequency + leakage current 
    Notes:
    Active power:
      The active current value assumes 50% read and write operations. And 50% Address/input/output 
      pins switch at user defined frequency of 1MHz.
    Standby leakage power:
      The standby current value is indepenent of frequecy and assumes all inputs/outputs are 
      stable when CEB =1'b1.



