  Timing Information:

    - CLK input slope = 0.008 ns.
    - Data input slope = 0.008 ns.
    - All timing parameters are measured from a logic threshold at 50% of input power supply.
    - Output reference voltage "H" = 50% of power supply, "L" = 50% of power supply.
    - Output loading = 0.005 pF.
    - Delay timing unit is nano second.

